    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3793910/extras/33ddff8e5492651199b16c80e65f00df.avif?t=1751306417\" data-has-big width=800 height=258 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to your cabin in the woods.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It seems you have been hit with a bit of bad weather this evening and you aren't sure your fire will make it through the night. Luckily there's plenty of firewood outside, if you can stand the cold...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenging the Cold</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this cozy collector game, your goal is to survive as long as possible by keeping warm. Collect branches to keep your fire lit, collect items to increase your survival chances, and choose between many upgrades and shop items to create the best chances of survival your own way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrading your Survival Kit</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Between each play-through, the branches you collect in total can be spent on chosen upgrades. These include the addition of items to the drop tables, choosing survival items for each run, changing how the cold affects you and more. There are many ways to play, but which will give you the best chances?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Surviving the Storm</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you play, you may notice not everything is within your control. The weather, item locations, and even your ability to find more firewood play a big part in your ability to survive. You will need to be able to adapt to the challenges at hand to set your high score.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The cold always wins...</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3793910/extras/33ddff8e5492651199b16c80e65f00df.avif?t=1751306417\" data-has-big width=800 height=258 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to your cabin in the woods.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It seems you have been hit with a bit of bad weather this evening and you aren't sure your fire will make it through the night. Luckily there's plenty of firewood outside, if you can stand the cold...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenging the Cold</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this cozy collector game, your goal is to survive as long as possible by keeping warm. Collect branches to keep your fire lit, collect items to increase your survival chances, and choose between many upgrades and shop items to create the best chances of survival your own way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrading your Survival Kit</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Between each play-through, the branches you collect in total can be spent on chosen upgrades. These include the addition of items to the drop tables, choosing survival items for each run, changing how the cold affects you and more. There are many ways to play, but which will give you the best chances?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Surviving the Storm</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you play, you may notice not everything is within your control. The weather, item locations, and even your ability to find more firewood play a big part in your ability to survive. You will need to be able to adapt to the challenges at hand to set your high score.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The cold always wins...</p>",
    "short_description": "Challenge the cold in this cozy, rogue-like survival game. Collect branches to keep your fire lit, choose shop items and upgrades to increase your chances of survival with dozens of ways to modify your game play. Remember, the cold always wins.",
